# Changelog
## [0.3.1] - Unreleased
### Bug fixes
 - Reject embedded NUL bytes in interface names.
 - Validate directly constructed attributes before emission, including known
   types supplied through raw attributes and nested statistics.
 - Reject oversized attribute lengths before the 16-bit field can truncate.
 - Return decode errors for malformed unchecked attribute buffers and nonempty
   flag or padding payloads.
 - Check the complete message and output buffer before writing its payload.
 - Document the remaining need for fallible validation and serialization APIs.

## [0.3.0] - 2026-10-21
### Breaking changes
 - api break: fix: encode L2TP_ATTR_DATA_SEQ as u8. (870c13d)

### New features
 - N/A

### Bug fixes
 - docs: clarify UDP checksum and FD attribute semantics. (29ef892)
 - validate L2TP interface name length. (2a204d3)
 - validate L2TP cookie lengths. (ba969f5)
 - Enable GitHub CI. (2d876f5)

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-16
 - Initial release
